WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:05.800
♪ A long, long time ago, ♪

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.200
♪ I can still remember ♪

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:13.500
♪ when the jump-cut was all the rage ♪

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.660
♪ And I knew if I could get it right, ♪

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.080
♪ that those friendly editors just might ♪

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.260
♪ maybe ♪

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:29.760
♪ feature me up on the front page... ♪

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.740
♪ But now that might be in the past. ♪

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:38.340
♪ To please the teeming corporate mass, ♪

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:41.960
♪ oh, that dream might now be dead, ♪

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.660
♪ despite the ads by my head. ♪

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:50.280
♪ And as hard as YouTube tries to ♪

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.920
♪ offer excuses and official whys, ♪

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:58.060
♪ we'll find the truth within the lies ♪

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:00.060
♪ the day ♪

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:04.840
♪ the YouTubes died. ♪

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:10.700
♪ Oh why, why am I even surprised? ♪

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:15.840
♪ Maybe YouTube can be Hulu and avoid its demise, ♪

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:20.100
♪ but if it comes at the cost of the little guys, ♪

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:24.080
♪ then I think that I might say my goodbyes... ♪

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:30.040
♪ I think that I might say my goodbyes. ♪

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.680
♪ Did you do the Five Facts thing ♪

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:38.300
♪ or participate in the Google Verb Meme? ♪

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:41.980
♪ Well I sure had fun with those. ♪

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.780
♪ And do you remember your First comment, ♪

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.540
♪ and how much those few characters meant? ♪

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:54.360
♪ Well, now you're a pro at the Captcha codes. ♪

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:58.860
♪ Well I know that I will miss it all ♪

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:03.040
♪ when I'm stuck behind this content wall. ♪

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:05.340
♪ Maybe it won't spell curtains. ♪

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.460
♪ I'll still have my subscriptions. ♪

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:13.260
♪ Yeah, I want Kevjumba, Smosh, and Buck! ♪

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:16.480
♪ Forget all your high-budget junk! ♪

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:20.040
♪ Well I hope they won't be out of luck ♪

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.560
♪ the day ♪

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:24.700
♪ the YouTubes died. ♪

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.620
♪ I started vloggin' ♪

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:29.740
♪ Why, why am I even surprised? ♪

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:33.160
♪ Maybe YouTube can be Hulu and avoid its demise, ♪

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:36.300
♪ but if it comes at the cost of the little guys, ♪

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.720
♪ then I think that I might say my goodbyes. ♪

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:45.080
♪ I think that I might say my goodbyes... ♪

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:47.880
Everybody with me one time!

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:51.200
♪ Why, why am I even surprised? ♪

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:55.340
♪ Maybe YouTube can be Hulu and avoid its demise, ♪

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:59.720
♪ but if it comes at the cost of the little guys, ♪

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:04.220
♪ then I think I might say my goodbyes. ♪

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:08.580
♪ I think I might say my goodbyes. ♪

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:15.860
That was hilariously difficult.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.660
First, I had to tape this to my camera

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.080
so that I could remember all the chords

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:22.760
So that's why I didn't realize there was a big reflection in my eyeball the whole time,

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.260
because I couldn't see myself on my monitor.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.800
And second, I kept doing this:

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.240
♪ Why, why am I even surprised? ♪

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:32.040
♪ Maybe Vader someday later,
now he's just a small-fry. ♪

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.880
♪ And those good 'ol boys
were drinking whiskey and rye- ♪

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.980
Yes, there can be too many parodies for one song.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.360
Sorry to contribute to that.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.660
Wardrobe change!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:42.200
Thank-yous go to all the people in that little YouTube chorus.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.500
Alan, fallofautumndistro, of course,

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:45.760
for writing most of that song.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.560
But most of all, thanks to all of you,

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.720
because YouTube is not what Google does.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.080
YouTube is what we do,

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.540
and what you're doing down there.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.240
I'm sure you know what I mean...by down there.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.380
So thank you for doing what we do,

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.980
because it's freakin' awesome.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:00.640
And I got a haircut! What do you think?

